Well, there *are* monsters that eat things, and they like iron balls
just as much as rocks.

Things I *wish* you could do about them:
- a lock pick ought to work
- you ought to be able to cut an iron chain with a pickaxe or
	wand of fire, at least with some reasonable probability.
	(If you're not fire-resistant, be careful not to shoot
	yourself in the foot, though.)
- rust monsters ought to do a job on iron chains.
- iron golems ought to eat them, and anything else iron.
- For that matter, you ought to be able to pick up and wield iron chains.
	The Biker From Hell swings his iron chain -More-
